=> THROW Error: Locale: Number.fromLocaleString(): Invalid format
Number.fromLocaleString(Qt.locale(), "1.234,5")
=> THROW Error: Locale: Number.fromLocaleString(): Invalid format
Qt.locale().numberOptions
=> number:0
Qt.locale().standaloneMonthName(4)
=> string:май
